      "summaries": {
        "en": "Paperless-ngx is an open-source document management system that solves the problem of physical document clutter by digitizing and organizing paperwork. Its technical strength lies in combining OCR with machine learning to automatically classify and tag scanned documents based on content patterns. Users can deploy it locally to create a searchable digital archive, then extend it through custom workflows or integrate with existing tools for streamlined document processing.",
        "zh": "Paperless-ngx 是一款开源文档管理系统，旨在解决纸质文件杂乱问题，通过扫描和数字化实现无纸化办公。其核心技术结合了光学字符识别与机器学习，能够自动分析文档内容并进行智能分类和标记，无需手动整理。用户可将其部署在本地服务器上，建立可搜索的电子档案库，还能通过自定义工作流或与其他工具集成，构建个性化的文档处理流程，特别适合需要管理大量合同、票据或档案的个人和小型团队。",
        "es": "Paperless-ngx is an open-source document management system that solves the problem of physical document clutter by digitizing and organizing paperwork. Its technical strength lies in combining OCR with machine learning to automatically classify and tag scanned documents based on content patterns. Users can deploy it locally to create a searchable digital archive, then extend it through custom workflows or integrate with existing tools for streamlined document processing.",
