          "what": "Paperless-ngx is an open-source document management system that solves the problem of physical document clutter by digitizing and organizing paperwork. Its technical strength lies in combining OCR with machine learning to automatically classify and tag scanned documents based on content patterns. Users can deploy it locally to create a searchable digital archive, then extend it through custom workflows or integrate with existing tools for streamlined document processing.",
