      "summaries": {
        "en": "FinceptTerminal is an open-source financial analytics platform that democratizes access to professional-grade market research tools, addressing the need for transparent, data-driven investment analysis. It integrates Python-based machine learning with interactive visualization to process complex financial datasets, enabling users to uncover patterns through customizable algorithms. Developers can extend its capabilities by adding new data sources or analytical models, while investors can use it to backtest strategies and explore real-time market trends through its intuitive interface.",
        "zh": "FinceptTerminal 是一款开源金融分析平台，旨在为投资者提供专业级的市场研究工具，解决传统金融软件封闭且昂贵的问题。它通过 Python 驱动，结合机器学习算法与交互式可视化技术，将复杂的市场数据转化为直观的图表和洞察，帮助用户识别趋势与风险。用户可自定义分析模块或集成新数据源，例如用于股票回测或宏观经济指标追踪，适合开发者构建定制化研究工具，也适合投资者进行数据驱动的决策探索。",
        "es": "FinceptTerminal is an open-source financial analytics platform that democratizes access to professional-grade market research tools, addressing the need for transparent, data-driven investment analysis. It integrates Python-based machine learning with interactive visualization to process complex financial datasets, enabling users to uncover patterns through customizable algorithms. Developers can extend its capabilities by adding new data sources or analytical models, while investors can use it to backtest strategies and explore real-time market trends through its intuitive interface.",
