        "zh": "Gemma-4-E4B-it 是一个多模态模型，能够同时处理图像和文本输入并生成文本回复，解决了传统模型难以统一理解视觉与语言信息的挑战。其核心技术在于采用统一的“任意到任意”架构，通过单一模型灵活处理不同模态组合，避免了传统方案中模块拼接的复杂性。开发者可通过 Hugging Face 平台加载模型，并基于自有数据微调，适用于构建智能问答系统、教育辅助工具或创意内容生成等场景，让机器更自然地理解图文混合信息。",
        "es": "Gemma-4-E4B-it is a versatile multimodal model that processes both images and text to generate text responses, enabling applications like visual question answering and content creation. Its key innovation lies in unified any-to-any processing, where a single architecture handles diverse input combinations without separate modules. Developers can fine-tune it on custom datasets using Hugging Face's transformers library, making it suitable for building interactive AI assistants or educational tools that combine visual and textual understanding.",
